        "tag": "blockquote",
        "text": "What to Expect the First Year, 3rd edition, Heidi Murkoff. WhatToExpect.com, Germs and Babies , November 2018. U.S. National Library of Medicine, Medline Plus, Choking , March 2016. U.S. Food and Drug Administration, Once Baby Arrives from Food Safety for Moms to Be , September 2018.",
        "text_sha256": "39638338b6035b6ca74f93f3cec08767bb06ab809f72a1011129aae7d135002d",
        "word_count": 46
      },
